  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "Retrospective Listed Building Consent and planning permission for 3 new windows on the southern elevation, 2 further new windows on the southern elevation, repointing works on the southern stack, the removal of un-breathable paint on brickwork and repainting with breathable paint and the installation of a new air brick and new internal chimney breast vent.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this consent.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of Section 18(a) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990 as amended.\r\n&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-7181c8c1-7fff-da3f-6e49-23dc3c654dee&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;The repointing shall be carried out using lime mortar with a ratio of 1:3 (lime:sand) or similar with flush joints (not ribbon or weatherstruck pointing). Cementitious mortars shall not be used. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-7181c8c1-7fff-da3f-6e49-23dc3c654dee&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;REASON: To ensure that special regard is paid to protecting the special architectural and historic interest and integrity of the building. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
